    "text": "By wspy_sports ,\n11 hours ago Sandwich fell 10-4 to Richmond-Burton despite out-hitting the Rockets 10-8 as Abigail Johnson led the Indians with three hits, Kayden Corneils added two hits, and both players doubled. Audryna Brain drove in two runs, while Coraline Stevens and Nevaeh Parker each added an RBI. Kendal Petre took the loss in the circle, pitching 5 1/3 innings and allowing 10 runs (eight earned) on seven hits with five walks and eight strikeouts. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
